# iOS quality

Direction: SwiftUI + HealthKit. Maestro / XCTest / SwiftLint / snapshot testing when running on macOS.

On Windows or Linux: validate source and project configuration only. **Do not claim Simulator or device verification.** Leave a reproducible macOS/CI path.

Never introduce Expo as the iOS UI architecture.
